'''Le'Grim Strikes''' (ジャイアント黒蔵強襲, ''Jaianto Kuro Zō Kyōshū'', '''Giant Kurozō's Assault''') is an event added in [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]] and released in [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, progress made in Le'Grim Strikes will reset when the event ends, allowing the player to collect the rewards again once the event returns. The boss of this Gauntlet is [[Le'Grim]], an increasingly powerful variant of [[Le'noir]] with even longer range.

==Overview==
===About===
Le'Grim Strikes contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Rampage Lvs'''. After beating a Rampage Lv, the player must wait for 30 minutes before they may proceed to the next one. Rewards for the first completion of a Rampage Lv can include XP, [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Gamatoto Expedition|Catamins]] and [[Ototo Corps|Materials]]. Every 10 Rampage Lvs plays out the same, but the strength magnifications and enemy base's HP are increased with each level.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Le'Grim Strikes/Rampage Lv1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Le'Grim Strikes is unlocked after clearing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

