==Continuation Stages==
After clearing any stage in this gauntlet, players have a chance to enter one of the following [[Continuation Stage]]s:
*[[Le'Grim Strikes/Cradle Wilderness (Deadly)|Cradle Wilderness (Deadly)]]
*[[Le'Grim Strikes/Summit Wilderness (Merciless)|Summit Wilderness (Merciless)]]
*[[Le'Grim Strikes/Frontier Wilderness (Merciless)|Frontier Wilderness (Merciless)]]

